{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":1,"id":"function-rendersnippet","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Function: renderSnippet()"}]},{"type":"code","value":"function renderSnippet<TProps>(snippet, params?): RenderSnippetConfig<TProps>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/svelte-table/src/render-component.ts#L104","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/svelte-table/src/render-component.ts:104"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Wraps a Svelte snippet so it can be returned from a column definition\nrenderer such as "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"cell"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"header"},{"type":"text","value":", or "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"footer"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The snippet must only take one parameter."}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"This is only to be used with Snippets - use "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"renderComponent"},{"type":"text","value":" for Svelte Components."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tprops","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TProps"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TProps"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"snippet","children":[{"type":"text","value":"snippet"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Snippet"},{"type":"text","value":"<["},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TProps"},{"type":"text","value":"]>"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The snippet to render."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"params","children":[{"type":"text","value":"params?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TProps"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The single parameter object passed to the snippet."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"RenderSnippetConfig"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TProps"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"RenderSnippetConfig"},{"type":"text","value":" consumed by the Svelte "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"FlexRender"},{"type":"text","value":" component."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"// +page.svelte\nconst defaultColumns = [\n  columnHelper.accessor('name', {\n    cell: cell => renderSnippet(nameSnippet, { name: cell.row.name }),\n  }),\n  columnHelper.accessor('state', {\n    cell: cell => renderSnippet(stateSnippet, { state: cell.row.state }),\n  }),\n]","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"see","children":[{"type":"text","value":"See"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"https://tanstack.com/table/latest/docs/guide/column-defs","children":[{"type":"text","value":"https://tanstack.com/table/latest/docs/guide/column-defs"}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"function-rendersnippet","text":"Function: renderSnippet()","level":1},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tprops","text":"TProps","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"snippet","text":"snippet","level":3},{"id":"params","text":"params?","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2},{"id":"see","text":"See","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n# Function: renderSnippet()\n\n```ts\nfunction renderSnippet<TProps>(snippet, params?): RenderSnippetConfig<TProps>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/svelte-table/src/render-component.ts:104](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/svelte-table/src/render-component.ts#L104)\n\nWraps a Svelte snippet so it can be returned from a column definition\nrenderer such as `cell`, `header`, or `footer`.\n\n*The snippet must only take one parameter.*\n\nThis is only to be used with Snippets - use `renderComponent` for Svelte Components.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TProps\n\n`TProps`\n\n## Parameters\n\n### snippet\n\n`Snippet`\\<\\[`TProps`\\]\\>\n\nThe snippet to render.\n\n### params?\n\n`TProps`\n\nThe single parameter object passed to the snippet.\n\n## Returns\n\n`RenderSnippetConfig`\\<`TProps`\\>\n\nA `RenderSnippetConfig` consumed by the Svelte `FlexRender` component.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\n// +page.svelte\nconst defaultColumns = [\n  columnHelper.accessor('name', {\n    cell: cell => renderSnippet(nameSnippet, { name: cell.row.name }),\n  }),\n  columnHelper.accessor('state', {\n    cell: cell => renderSnippet(stateSnippet, { state: cell.row.state }),\n  }),\n]\n```\n\n## See\n\n[https://tanstack.com/table/latest/docs/guide/column-defs](https://tanstack.com/table/latest/docs/guide/column-defs)\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: renderSnippet\ntitle: renderSnippet\n---\n\n# Function: renderSnippet()\n\n```ts\nfunction renderSnippet<TProps>(snippet, params?): RenderSnippetConfig<TProps>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/svelte-table/src/render-component.ts:104](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/svelte-table/src/render-component.ts#L104)\n\nWraps a Svelte snippet so it can be returned from a column definition\nrenderer such as `cell`, `header`, or `footer`.\n\n*The snippet must only take one parameter.*\n\nThis is only to be used with Snippets - use `renderComponent` for Svelte Components.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TProps\n\n`TProps`\n\n## Parameters\n\n### snippet\n\n`Snippet`\\<\\[`TProps`\\]\\>\n\nThe snippet to render.\n\n### params?\n\n`TProps`\n\nThe single parameter object passed to the snippet.\n\n## Returns\n\n`RenderSnippetConfig`\\<`TProps`\\>\n\nA `RenderSnippetConfig` consumed by the Svelte `FlexRender` component.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\n// +page.svelte\nconst defaultColumns = [\n  columnHelper.accessor('name', {\n    cell: cell => renderSnippet(nameSnippet, { name: cell.row.name }),\n  }),\n  columnHelper.accessor('state', {\n    cell: cell => renderSnippet(stateSnippet, { state: cell.row.state }),\n  }),\n]\n```\n\n## See\n\n[https://tanstack.com/table/latest/docs/guide/column-defs](https://tanstack.com/table/latest/docs/guide/column-defs)\n"}
